        },
        "valueString": "Calm and cooperative, with good eye contact; speech normal; affect full and reactive. Thought process linear and goal-directed. No delusions, ideas of reference, or current auditory or visual hallucinations. No suicidal or homicidal ideation. Oriented; cognition grossly intact; insight and judgment intact."
